Z||000001||Monkeyman||07-15-2001||04:49 AM||||There was a myth that about a dozen cars came out of the factory and were sold to the public with power steering, but nobody's ever been able to prove that it happened.  So, the official answer is "No.".  Never any Fieros with power steering unless they're sitting in the back of some GM execs garage collecting dust and value.<P>There have been a few that have suggested various forms of power steering, but none have actually been retrofitted on any Fiero as far as I know.  Do a search and you should find a few threads about it.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
